    "title": "Hiring Production Engineer at Bajaj Electricals Capital India",
    "description": "Bajaj Electricals Capital India is actively seeking a talented and motivated Production Engineer to join our dynamic team in Raipur. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Bajaj Electricals Capital India:\nBajaj Electricals Capital India is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Oversee daily production operations to meet output targets\n• Ensure product quality meets internal and customer specifications\n• Manage supplier quality audits and vendor development\n• Coordinate with design and engineering teams on product improvements\n• Manage raw material procurement and inventory levels\n• Monitor equipment performance and coordinate preventive maintenance\n• Implement lean manufacturing and continuous improvement initiatives\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• BPharm / MPharm / PharmD\n• 0-1 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in AutoCAD\n• Proficiency in APQP\n• Proficiency in 5S\n• Proficiency in ERP Systems\n• Proficiency in SolidWorks\n• Proficiency in Kaizen\n• Proficiency in PLC/SCADA\n• Proficiency in SAP MM/PP\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Salary Range: 2.5 LPA - 6 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Raipur, Chhattisgarh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Bajaj Electricals Capital India!",
